[en.FOCUS_C12_REFUGEE_FROM_LAS_PEGASUS]
Refugee from Las Pegasus

[en.FOCUS_C12_REFUGEE_FROM_LAS_PEGASUS_desc]
After the Last Roundup, many impoverished ponies flocked to the Western Equestria region of the farm, but they didn’t stay there. Instead, they chose to brave the dangers and continue onwards to Las Pegasus for survival. At that time, the quarry farm was overwhelmed, while Rockmont flourished.\n\nNow, Las Pegasus has hit a development bottleneck. If we can open our arms to the ponies of Las Pegasus, at least some of them would be willing to give us a second chance.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_REFUGEE_FROM_LAS_PEGASUS]
来自洛马基的难民

[zh.FOCUS_C12_REFUGEE_FROM_LAS_PEGASUS_desc]
在终末之战后，许多饥寒交迫的小马来到了采石农场的西小马利亚地区，但他们并未在此停留，而是选择冒着生命危险继续前往洛马基谋生，当时的采石农场自顾不暇，而洛马基蒸蒸日上。\n如今，洛马基陷入了发展瓶颈，如果我们能向洛马基的小马们敞开怀抱，至少一部分小马们愿意给我们第二次机会。

